    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33662" root="فرق" body-key="f">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انفرق</span></b> , of which <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْفَرَقٌ</span> may be an inf. n. [like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْفِرَاقٌ</span>], as well as a n. of place, <i>It was,</i> or <i>became,
separated,</i> or <i>divided.</i> (O, K.) See also 5.
[Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انفرق الفَجْرُ</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْفَلَقَ</span> [<i>The dawn
broke</i>]. (TA.)

